{"kind":"sentence","lang":"en","entities":{"85555":{"renderings":[{"id":"4a975b6b46cf557b","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"318159"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Some say the beauty is more important than virtue."}]},"85570":{"renderings":[{"id":"824b0d59e6ed4de6","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"318143"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"What is beautiful is not always good."}]},"127045":{"renderings":[{"id":"9b95a14eee5b364f","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"277045"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Knowledge is power, but it is power for evil just as much as for good."}]},"140923":{"renderings":[{"id":"89b6fc3fd0030d64","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"273649"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"It is \"doubt\" that turns good into bad."}]},"165591":{"renderings":[{"id":"0966c363638d9d65","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"248914"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"We must seek after the true, the good and the beautiful."}]},"170406":{"renderings":[{"id":"0807ffb4e6db7461","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"21087"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The best is often the enemy of the good."}]},"181522":{"renderings":[{"id":"68d0daf8d0d9d5e2","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"19274"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Competition is neither good nor evil in itself."}]},"186827":{"renderings":[{"id":"a9bcd4c1306b718e","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"23964"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"With every increase of scientific knowledge, man's power for evil is increased in the same proportion as his power for good."}]},"186851":{"renderings":[{"id":"0ce87e41d131b13d","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"23988"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"As scientists keep insisting, there is neithe